    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You keep quiet books on how hard truth will be to install.</em></p><p>You can spend <strong>10 minutes</strong> performing a brief analytical rite (charts, string maps, numerology, argument trees) focused on a planned <strong>Alignment Shift</strong> for a Hex or Spark.</p><ul><li>At the end of the rite, the GM tells you whether the upcoming Align-Shift DC for this attempt is trending <strong>easier than usual</strong>, <strong>about normal</strong>, or <strong>harder than usual</strong>, based on current fiction, opposition, and setup.</li><li>This does not give you exact numbers or guarantee success; it provides a <strong>forecast</strong> so you know whether to bring more OPs, allies, or preparation.</li></ul><p>In other words, you glimpse whether the Lens is currently tilted in your favor.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"wlTruthPrism\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Prism Ledger</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 10-min rite &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Downtime (10 min) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Spend 10 minutes on charts/string maps/numerology focused on a planned Alignment Shift. GM tells you whether the upcoming Align-Shift DC is trending easier / normal / harder. Forecast only — no exact numbers.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
